OL,3,GNEWSATribute to 'deeply loved' son as
OL,4,Apolice make fourth shooting arrest
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a man who was shot dead
OL,7,Fin West Lothian have said he was
OL,8,F"deeply loved" as police confirmed the
OL,9,Farrest of a fourth suspect.
OL,11,FBilly Watson, 35, was fatally injured
OL,12,Fin a property on Harestanes Road,
OL,13,FArmadale, at about 11:50 on 12
OL,14,FSeptember.
OL,16,FThree men have already appeared in
OL,17,Fcourt charged with murder and
OL,18,Fattempting to defeat the ends of
OL,19,Fjustice.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
