OL,4,Apolice make fourth shooting arrest
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Tuesday officers said a 20-year-old
OL,7,Fman had also been arrested in
OL,8,Fconnection with the death and inquiries
OL,9,Fwere ongoing.
